          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="copy-annotation">
              <label>原書衣大題</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">真理課選</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="copy-annotation">
              <label>後貼展覽文字籤</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">Law of God. Comments on the 10 Commandments.</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="copy-annotation">
              <label>後貼中文展覽籤</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">□律法十誡註釋／二課其一　王炳堃／二課其二　何玉泉</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="copy-annotation">
              <label>所藏號鉛筆</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">Sinica 2335</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="copy-annotation">
              <label>黃色展覽標</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">INTERNATIONAL HEALTH EXHIBITION.／Exhibitor: CHINESE GOVERNMENT.／No. 16 of Class II.／Title in Chinese 真理課選／English The Law of God／Author Ho Yü ch'üan.／1 Volumes.</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：展覽標下方卷數照寫，Translator 行空白。小白籤題首有黃籤遮住。封面標籤並列兩名，實際底本收其一，署名依正文首幅。另見兩組淡色舊編號，末位未完全辨清。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="single:None">
              <quote>後貼中文展覽籤</quote>
              <note type="editorial">此處墨跡或構件不清，以□保留未定字。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
