        <pb n="2" facs="#f02" />
        <div n="2" type="scan" subtype="housing-or-binding">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="no-transcribed-text" />
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：前襯。可見淺淡紙框、未見獨立文字。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="3" facs="#f03" />
        <div n="3" type="scan" subtype="title-and-series-contents">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f03-s-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">西歷一千八百八十一年</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f03-s-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">真理課選</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f03-s-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">光緒七年歲次辛巳　漢口聖教書局印發</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：正式內封，中題及左右刊年、印行所分三欄。下框見局部圓印，淡印未釋。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="single:None">
              <quote />
              <note type="editorial">正式內封，中題及左右刊年、印行所分三欄。下框見局部圓印，淡印未釋。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="4" facs="#f04" />
        <div n="4" type="scan" subtype="title-and-series-contents">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f04-s-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">真理課選目錄</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f04-s-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">初課上帝惟一造化之主衆宜服命共二篇</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f04-s-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">二課上帝律法十誡註釋共二篇</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f04-s-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">三課古今拜主理宜何禮共二篇</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f04-s-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">四課上帝理世賞善罰惡</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f04-s-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">五課禍福未正天道之妙</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f04-s-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">六課今世虛空當求實福</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f04-s-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">七課悔改重生聖經實理共二篇</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f04-s-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">八課耶穌臨世全應預言</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f04-s-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">九課耶穌恩救聖神德化</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：內封後為全系列九課總目。第五課「未」原形長橫和短橫待核。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="single:6">
              <quote>未</quote>
              <note type="editorial">內封後為全系列九課總目。第五課「未」原形長橫和短橫待核。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="5" facs="#f05" />
        <div n="5" type="scan" subtype="printed-commentary">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f05-s-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">上帝律法十誡註釋其一</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f05-s-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">嘗思家法設自家主、國法設自人君、而天法設自上帝、以其為天地</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f05-s-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">主也、上帝垂示之法有十、故曰十誡、託摩西而傳於以色列民載於</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f05-s-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">兩碑、一示人行於上帝之分、二示人行於人之分、故天倫人倫之理</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f05-s-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">而俱全、夫十誡之理包涵萬象、終身行之而未能宿儒解之而不盡、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f05-s-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">然其大端要旨雖婦孺可以與知、故教中人無論白叟黃童皆學此</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f05-s-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">十誡、因其為至要也、然此十誡云何、○首誡云、我耶和華爾之上帝、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f05-s-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">導爾出埃及、脫爾於賤役者、余而外不可別有上帝、○伊昔以色列</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f05-s-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">民在埃及為人賤役、上帝導之出埃及而入迦南、夫埃及苦海也、指</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f05-s-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">魔鬼之國、迦南樂土也、指上帝之國、萬民原為魔鬼之役、甚於以色</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="11" xml:id="f05-s-c11">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">列民之在埃及、誰救萬民出魔鬼國而入上帝國乎、其為上帝也、以</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f05-s-c11">
              <label>內題欄下小字右行</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">廣東禮</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f05-s-c11">
              <label>內題欄下小字左行</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">賢會</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f05-s-c11">
              <label>內題欄下署名</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">王炳堃</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f05-s-c11">
              <label>左書口上</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">真理課選</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f05-s-c11">
              <label>左書口中</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">二課　上帝律法十誡註釋</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f05-s-c11">
              <label>左書口下</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">一</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：這一幅取完整左主頁。小字左右合讀為「廣東禮賢會」。署名末字下見土，上見左右同構筆畫，作「堃」，同時有牛津 Serica 書目相合。原墨小頓點以「、」、空圈以「○」記。裝訂內沿同框鄰頁未收入。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="6" facs="#f06" />
        <div n="6" type="scan" subtype="printed-commentary">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f06-s-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">上帝之權如此其大、之恩如此其深、故當敬畏敬愛、全靠上帝、愈於</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f06-s-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">萬物、夫異邦人拜偶像、事邪神、是別有上帝、犯此誡也、教內人雖不</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f06-s-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">拜有形之偶像但多拜無形之偶像、如好貨財、私妻子、與夫愛一切</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f06-s-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">世物、愈於上帝、有一如此是亦別有上帝、犯此誡也、撫懷內問誰愛</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f06-s-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">全能上帝、畢生□懈、始終不渝、有一念之或弛、則全誡皆犯、該十誡</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f06-s-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">無有人盡守、全守十誡者、獨一救主耶穌而已、夫十誡之理皆要、而</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f06-s-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">以首為尤要、蓋愛上帝為萬善之源、人苟愛上帝則不敢犯其禁、必</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f06-s-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">悅從其命、人犯他誡者、因未能守此首誡矣、○二誡云、毋雕偶像、天</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f06-s-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">上地下水中百物勿作像象之、毋拜跪、毋崇奉、以我耶和華卽爾之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f06-s-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">上帝、斷不容以他上帝匹我、惡我者、禍之、討其父之罪於其子之身、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="11" xml:id="f06-s-c11">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">至三四世、愛我守我誡者、福之至千百世、○上帝乃至聖之神、無形</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：這一幅取完整右主頁。書口右沿僅見部分字側及魚尾殘筆，另見前幅書口。第5欄「懈」上字外框內有數橫，圖形候「周」，語例候「罔」，暫留□。「始終不渝」之「渝」候比「淪」。第9欄先「像」後「象」，前者有亻。裝訂內沿同框鄰頁未收入。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="single:5">
              <quote>□</quote>
              <note type="editorial">部分筆畫不清，原圖字形待核。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="7" facs="#f07" />
        <div n="7" type="scan" subtype="printed-commentary">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f07-s-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">無象無可比儗、故不能以世物像之、孔子云、始作俑者其無後乎、為</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f07-s-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">其像人而用之也、像人倘且不可、況像上帝乎、故凡以世物像上帝</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f07-s-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">者、是汚慢上帝、其罪實甚、夫上帝既不能以物像之、而拜上帝之禮、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f07-s-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">又不能以物事之、耶穌曰、上帝乃神、拜之者必以神以誠、且夫上帝</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f07-s-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">至義、故警逆其誡者之罰、自父及子至三四世、人若不愛上帝則多</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f07-s-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">貽謀不善、世濟其惡、所謂作不善之家必有餘殃也、而上帝亦為至</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f07-s-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">仁、故許守其誡者之福、至於千百世、人能愛上帝則裕後多良子孫</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f07-s-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">善繼善述、所謂作善之家必有餘慶也、人奈何不畏上帝之義、而懷</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f07-s-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">其仁哉、○三誡云、爾上帝耶和華之名勿妄稱、妄稱者不得為無罪、○上</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f07-s-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">帝之名至聖、非人所能妄稱、凡用上帝之名發假誓言咒詛行詐偽</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="11" xml:id="f07-s-c11">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">等情、皆為有瀆上帝之名、是謂妄稱、夫妄稱上帝之名何以其罪若</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f07-s-c11">
              <label>左書口上</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">真理課選</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f07-s-c11">
              <label>左書口中</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">二課　上帝律法十誡註釋</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f07-s-c11">
              <label>左書口下</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">二</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：這一幅取完整左主頁。第2欄「人」後字有亻，作「倘」。第3欄「汚」及第1欄「儗」照錄。裝訂內沿同框鄰頁未收入。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="8" facs="#f08" />
        <div n="8" type="scan" subtype="printed-commentary">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f08-s-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">是之重、蓋言為心之聲、言妄者其心必慢、侮慢上帝其罪不重而何、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f08-s-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">君親之名倘為臣子者所宜敬避、況上帝名乎、然上帝非禁人不稱</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f08-s-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">其名、祇禁其妄矣、凡善稱其名、如歌詩、頌禱、講道等情、是謂善用其</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f08-s-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">名、斯為上帝所悅、至於歌詩頌禱、講道之際稱上帝之名而心不誠、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f08-s-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">亦為妄稱、抑從道人之行不端、招人誡毀、亦為有瀆上帝之名、人何</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f08-s-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">可不檢身防口哉、○第四誡云、當以安息日為聖日、永誌勿忘、六日</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f08-s-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">間宜操作、以竣諸工焉、越至七日、則耶和華爾上帝之安息也、是日</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f08-s-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">爾與子女、僕婢牲畜、及遠人主於爾家者、皆勿操作、蓋六日間耶和</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f08-s-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">華造天地海萬物、第七日乃止、故耶和華以安息日為聖日、而錫福</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f08-s-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">焉、○夫安息日自開闢而來已然、以此而申言之故曰誌、以是日異</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="11" xml:id="f08-s-c11">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">於常日故曰聖、惟其為聖也、故凡一切世事、不可作於是日、六日作</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f08-s-c11">
              <label>右書口上殘字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">真理課選</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：這一幅取完整右主頁。右書口上段字體受裁，但「真理課選」仍可辨，以下僅見魚尾殘線。第5欄「招人誡毀」的「誡」與第6欄「第四誡」同形，照錄。第8欄「遠人」下見「主」形。裝訂內沿同框鄰頁未收入。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="9" facs="#f09" />
        <div n="9" type="scan" subtype="printed-commentary">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f09-s-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">工獲糧以養身、七日安息聽道以養靈、凡人信上帝所許、雖是日不</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f09-s-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">作工而亦無缺、古今來有明驗矣、雖安息日特為養靈、而亦養身、蓋</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f09-s-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">人終年勤劬無少休息、未免精力太耗、身體因之而弱、必有所靜憩</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f09-s-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">以固元神、七日一週、其數不疏不數、易曰天心、七日一來復、大若是</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f09-s-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">安息日之遺意、可見中國古昔亦或有此安息日、獨後人遺忘矣、但</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f09-s-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">是日聽道之餘、亦非終日禪坐、凡為上帝之道與益人之舉、雖至勞</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f09-s-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">亦可為之、故耶穌於安息日施醫講道亦所不辭、然有要務雖已事</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f09-s-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">亦可為之、蓋為人而立安息日、非為安息日而立人、獨為世事之利</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f09-s-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">則是日不可為矣、且也今之安息為將來永遠安息之表、凡誠心而</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f09-s-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">守今之安息、可獲將來永遠安息焉、○五誡云敬爾父母、則可於耶</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="11" xml:id="f09-s-c11">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">和華爾上帝所賜之地、而享遐齡焉、○不可見而至大者為上帝、可</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f09-s-c11">
              <label>左側版心上</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">真理課選</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f09-s-c11">
              <label>左側版心中</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">二課　上帝律法十誡註釋</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f09-s-c11">
              <label>左側版心下</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">三</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：十一欄。右內沿露出前一幅同頁相鄰的殘欄，未重錄。原小撇點以「、」編碼，分節原有空心圈以「○」編碼。第4欄的「大」候「殆」，原圖暫保留可見字形；「曰天心」的「心」後有小刻點，保留。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="10" facs="#f10" />
        <div n="10" type="scan" subtype="printed-commentary">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f10-s-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">見而至大者為兩親、上四誡論人行於上帝之分、以下六誡則論人</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f10-s-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">行於人人之分、在人中以父母為首、故命敬父母、中國言孝亦詳、然</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f10-s-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">不出敬之之範圍、人能盡敬、必能敬孝也、所謂父母者、非第兩親之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f10-s-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">謂凡君相有司、兄長伯叔與夫一切在上者皆是、凡不服居上者、即</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f10-s-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">不服上帝、華人多謂耶穌教不重五倫、其亦未觀此五誡矣、在十誡</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f10-s-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">中許人以福惟此五誡、可見向人之分莫大於父母也、然世俗多有</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f10-s-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">以不孝為孝者、如祭祀風水之類、此有背上帝之道、不可曲從、孝當</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f10-s-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">分眞偽、衡以上帝之道、則知所從違矣、○六誡云毋殺人、○所謂毋</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f10-s-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">殺人者、不第指以刀以梃、或樸或鴆、此等之殺、人或不敢犯之、然有</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f10-s-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">以心殺人者、如見仇讎有難而喜其災、鄰里臨危而不拯其厄、或懷</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="11" xml:id="f10-s-c11">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">嫉妬、或生怨恨者比比皆是、亦有以言殺人者、如播弄是非、敗人名</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：十一欄。主頁右側版心的題字被截，只見殘形，不據相鄰幅補錄；左內沿鄰頁不重錄。第3欄「敬孝」照圖，雖有語意疑慮不倒字。第9欄「樸」原形候「檏」，以原圖木旁及右部釐清前暫留候。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="single:3">
              <quote>敬孝</quote>
              <note type="editorial">十一欄。主頁右側版心的題字被截，只見殘形，不據相鄰幅補錄；左內沿鄰頁不重錄。第3欄「敬孝」照圖，雖有語意疑慮不倒字。第9欄「樸」原形候「檏」，以原圖木旁及右部釐清前暫留候。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="single:9">
              <quote>樸</quote>
              <note type="editorial">十一欄。主頁右側版心的題字被截，只見殘形，不據相鄰幅補錄；左內沿鄰頁不重錄。第3欄「敬孝」照圖，雖有語意疑慮不倒字。第9欄「樸」原形候「檏」，以原圖木旁及右部釐清前暫留候。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="11" facs="#f11" />
        <div n="11" type="scan" subtype="printed-commentary">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f11-s-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">節、及謗讟詈罵等情、他如訟師逞刁筆、小夫尋短見、與夫溺女等事、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f11-s-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">皆在殺人之列、抑好勇鬥狠、耽酒色、食鴉片、凡有傷生之具、亦犯六</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f11-s-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">誡之條、人固不可殺、而禽獸則何如、其有毒者可殺之以除害、如虎</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f11-s-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">狼蛇蝎、其有用者可殺之以益人、如牛羊鹿豕、但使之速亡、以減其</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f11-s-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">苦、釋氏禁殺牲亦矯枉過正之論、至若有司執法、可誅宼、軍士為國</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f11-s-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">可殺敵、如此之殺為無過、但宜存矜恤、不可狥暴、○七誡云毋行淫</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f11-s-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">所謂毋行淫者、不第指辱人妻女之謂、蓋淫之為狀甚多、如意存污</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f11-s-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">念、心淫也、喜看美色、目淫也、悅聽邪曲、耳淫也、好談閨閫、口淫也、有</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f11-s-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">捫不潔、手淫也、他如非姦、故出妻而他娶、棄夫而他從、亦為犯淫、至</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f11-s-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">若納妾、在中國不以為淫、律以上帝之法、則為淫、一夫一婦人道之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="11" xml:id="f11-s-c11">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">正、過此則為淫、起在聖經禁淫更有深意、凡人離上帝而拜邪神、猶</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f11-s-c11">
              <label>左側版心上</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">真理課選</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f11-s-c11">
              <label>左側版心中</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">二課　上帝律法十誡註釋</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f11-s-c11">
              <label>左側版心下</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">四</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：十一欄；右內沿鄰頁不重錄。第2欄「狠」候「狼」、第5欄「宼」候「寇」、第7欄「辱」候「奪」、第8欄「閫」候「閬」、第9欄「捫」暫依所見。原書第6欄圈上無句末撇點，接下一欄。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="12" facs="#f12" />
        <div n="12" type="scan" subtype="printed-commentary">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f12-s-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">婦女棄夫而苟合、是謂神姦、故凡屬上帝之民宜身心潔淨、言行端</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f12-s-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">方、人之身稱為上帝之殿、人惡可汚上帝之殿乎、○八誡云毋攘竊、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f12-s-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">○所謂毋攘竊者、非第指公然、之刦奪偷盜已也、如交易而不公平、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f12-s-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">放債而索重息、欠債而不愿償拾物而不反原主、為官而受苞苴、為</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f12-s-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">民而抗錢糧、至於主人刻薄、是盜工人之力、工人怠惰、是盜主人之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f12-s-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">資、劫奪人美是盜名、擅自專制是盜權、凡物苟非已有、雖一毫取之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f12-s-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">而亦盜、故宜杜漸防微、勿以小而忽諸、蓋小可能釀大、凡言損於人</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f12-s-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">者固不敢為、亦宜盡力以衛人之家資、而增益之焉、○九誡云毋妄</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f12-s-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">證、○所謂勿妄證者、指一切說誑、假偽、毀謗、詐騙等情、是非固不可</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f12-s-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">播弄、他人陰私亦不可妄發、當隱惡揚善、勿敗他人名節、臨危不可</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="11" xml:id="f12-s-c11">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">苟免、約信要近於義、勿輕言諾以貽後悔、魔鬼為誑之父、說誑者是</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f12-s-c11">
              <label>右側版心上（截）</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">真理課選</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：主面十一欄，左內沿下一頁不重錄。右側版心中下沿出圖邊界，多不全。第3欄「刦」右見直刂，與第6欄「劫」形不同；第4欄「愿」取原見厂下心形，第6欄「已」候「己」。兩類原刻句讀照見記為「、」「○」，不補未見的標點。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="13" facs="#f13" />
        <div n="13" type="scan" subtype="printed-commentary">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f13-s-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">魔鬼之子、故凡屬上帝之民者必信必誠焉、○十誡云毋貪人宅第、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f13-s-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">妻室僕婢牛驢與凡屬於人者、　首誡命為上帝是為善之源、十誡</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f13-s-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">懲貪心是絕惡之根、可見十誡首尾相應、如環焉、貪不第指財利而</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f13-s-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">言、人之所貪各有不同、有貪名者、有貪財者、有貪色者、貪名必至於</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f13-s-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">傲、貪財必至於盜、貪色必至於淫、其勢使然、凡事欲止其流、必先塞</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f13-s-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">其源、欲禁惡行、必先禁欲心、十誡曰毋貪、是正本清源之法、夫貪由</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f13-s-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">於不知自足、故人不論處於何境、當知饜足、毋豔羨焉、○上十誡之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f13-s-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">理至微而亦至義、天下無人盡守、蓋人皆有罪故也、但上帝垂示守</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f13-s-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">者獲其福、不守者膺其禍、誰能免其刑乎、以法則不能免也、上帝預</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f13-s-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">知人不盡守、而垂示此誡、欲人因此而識己罪、引而之基督、蓋全守</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="11" xml:id="f13-s-c11">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">十誡者獨一救主而已、人信此耶穌、則　上帝因耶穌之守、亦視吾人</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f13-s-c11">
              <label>左側版心上</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">真理課選</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f13-s-c11">
              <label>左側版心中</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">二課　上帝律法十誡註釋</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f13-s-c11">
              <label>左側版心下</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">五</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：主面十一欄，右內沿前一頁不重錄。第2欄「首」與第11欄末段「上帝」前確見留空，暫以一全形空格表示；第11欄「耶穌」下「則」僅殘筆，留候讀。版心外側稍裁，所讀非另外正文。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="14" facs="#f14" />
        <div n="14" type="scan" subtype="printed-commentary">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f14-s-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">為守、故經云義人以信得生也、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f14-s-c01">
              <label>右側版心上（截）</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">真理課選</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：承接前頁「亦視吾人」。正文僅右端一短欄，至「也」及其右原刻撇點即止。後為分欄線、未印欄及背透淡痕，沒有正文、另題或署款；右側版心中下僅存截筆，葉碼不確讀。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="single:1">
              <quote>也</quote>
              <note type="editorial">承接前頁「亦視吾人」。正文僅右端一短欄，至「也」及其右原刻撇點即止。後為分欄線、未印欄及背透淡痕，沒有正文、另題或署款；右側版心中下僅存截筆，葉碼不確讀。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="15" facs="#f15" />
        <div n="15" type="scan" subtype="housing-or-binding">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="no-transcribed-text" />
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：本件後襯頁。圖右內沿部分重見前幅尾文，不另錄。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="16" facs="#f16" />
        <div n="16" type="scan" subtype="housing-or-binding">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="no-transcribed-text" />
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：後書衣。無正文。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
